        "original_id": "a1988ad6-11d4-543a-80ca-0988bb6710fe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Maitland, Alan Faneca\n- Sports Awards: Super Bowl ring, Vince Lombardi Trophy\n- Organizations: National Football League, Pittsburgh Steelers, Seattle Seahawks\n- Events: Super Bowl XL\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Maitland was born on February 8, 1948.\n- Jack Maitland is a former American football running back who played in the National Football League in the 1970s.\n- Jack Maitland earned a Super Bowl ring.\n- The Vince Lombardi Trophy is awarded only to the winning team ownership.\n- A Super Bowl ring is kept by players and team members as a collectible memento symbolizing victory.\n- Alan Faneca was selected to the Pro Bowl nine times and named first-team All-Pro six times.\n- Alan Faneca won a Super Bowl ring with the Pittsburgh Steelers in Super Bowl XL.\n- In Super Bowl XL, the Pittsburgh Steelers defeated the Seattle Seahawks.",
